units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 482748 temp
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 10 iso 1 1 10
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp epair etotal press vol
run 220000
